   "replace_message": "<p>Compatibility and Installation</p><ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 30px;\"><li>Synology Active Insight is compatible with DSM 7.0 Preview and above.</li></ol><p>What's New</p><ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 30px;\"><li>Synology Active Insight lets you monitor the health and performance of multiple Synology NAS using a web portal and a dedicated mobile app.</li><li>Supports health notifications and reports on storage, LUN, data transfer, and other abnormalities.<ul style=\"list-style: disc; padding-left: 30px;\"><li>Provides detailed troubleshooting advice through email and mobile app.</li><li>Lets you send Synology NAS status and event summary reports to one or more recipients</li></ul></li><li>Performance highlights:<ul style=\"list-style: disc; padding-left: 30px;\"><li>Ranks Synology NAS by performance metric for easier recognition of abnormalities.</li><li>Metrics overview for each Synology NAS can be adjusted according to use case.</li></ul></li></ol><p>Limitations</p><ol style=\"list-style: decimal; padding-left: 30px;\"><li>In a Synology High Availability cluster, only the active server is monitored.</li><li>Synology Active Insight mobile app is not supported on tablets.</li><li>Synology Active Insight is not available on Synology NAS models with 256 MB or smaller system memory.</li></ol>",
